00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:52.280
Commander!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.110
Please hurry!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.820
Everybody's already fighting!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.240
It's almost finished.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.660
Okay, all done.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:05.790
Normally, we'd need to scan it in mobile suit mode...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.170
We don't have time.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.460
I'm launching now!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.590
We don't have a choice.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.590
G-Strider, prepare to launch!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:27.600
<i>Stay in Strider form until you get to the combat zone.</i>

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.650
<i>You've got three times the thrust in this form.</i>

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.440
Understood.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.000
Gundam... We're not dying today.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.080
Asemu Asuno, AGE-2 Gundam! Here I go!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.690
Sorry I'm late, Commander Woolf!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.730
You'll have to work hard to make up for it!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:10.770
Yes, sir!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.930
Wow...

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.390
So that's...

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.310
The Gundam...

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:45.770
Not too shabby.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.200
Damn it!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.280
My hands are tied!{I can't do anything like this!}

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.120
Are you okay?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:10.960
Yes, somehow!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.290
I'm finally back in the groove.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.670
So that's Commander Woolf...

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.510
The White Wolf!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:18.970
Where are the rest of them?

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.430
Wait, Asemu!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:25.970
Don't shoot!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.350
Why not?

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.060
Be aware of your spatial position{positional relationshiops}!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.850
The Diva's about to enter your line of fire.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:34.190
Miss, and you'll hit the Diva.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.650
They're heading for the Diva!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.820
Asemu!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.160
Obright...

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.950
You're in charge of Max and Arisa.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.620
<i>Roger.</i>

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.500
Two Dorados are approaching the Diva.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.080
Commence counterattack! {counterattack}

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.540
But they're too close to the Gundam!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.840
Asemu! Get out of the Diva's line of fire.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.050
Corporal Asemu! That's an order!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.560
Asemu?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:25.780
There!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.460
What? {barely audible}

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.800
Amazing...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.840
The Gundam AGE-2 has destroyed both Dorados.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.720
He took out two at once!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.850
We won!

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.140
We did it!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.600
We destroyed them all!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:52.810
<i>I did it! I did it!</i>

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:54.810
Jeez... Even his son's gonna give me a hard time.

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.530
Mazato Langley's team has been wiped out.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.780
It seems that most of them were shot down by a new model of Gundam.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.490
A new model?

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.950
<i>Asemu... is that you?</i>

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.370
You disobeyed your orders.{This feels like Eva all over again}

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.540
But I defeated the enemy.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.880
In the military, orders are absolute.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.800
You disobeyed your commander's orders, and put the ship in danger.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.920
Now, now...

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.090
It was his first battle.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:28.180
You keep quiet, Commander Woolf!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:31.180
We'll be discussing your responsibility for this later, as his superior.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:35.520
Corporal Asemu Asuno, you're confined to quarters until further notice. {fuck off card}

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:37.900
