00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.360
You need to realize that you're responsible for your actions.{TAKE RESPONSIBILITY. fuck me xD}

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.480
Now go.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.400
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.250
